  "question": {
    "text": "The metre bridge wire <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> shown in the adjoining figure is <math><mn>100 cm</mn></math> long. When <math><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>cm</mi><mo>,</mo></math> no deflection occurs in the galvanometer. What is the value of <math><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;(in ohm)?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/deepa.PNG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 115px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "14",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>ρ</mi></math> be the resistance per unit length of the metre bridge wire.<br /><br />From the condition of balance of Wheatstone bridge.<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>70</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
